---
description: Typed environment variables via t3-env
globs: env.ts,.env*,next.config.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `docs/constitutions/t3-env.md` and `docs/constitutions/zod.md`.

- Access configuration through `env` from `env.ts`, never raw `process.env` in application code (except `runtimeEnv` wiring).
- Add every new variable to `env.ts`, `.env.example`, and the t3-env constitution examples in the same change.
- Fail at build time for missing or invalid values.
